      "message": "the fix is to get the Android team to setup the sync, not to fork the repos.  i don\u0027t think the situation is nearly as dire as you portray.  the vast majority of people who develop this project are CrOS devs, and we know what\u0027s going on.",
      "parentUuid": "c15ae896_d85b9d05",
      "revId": "87bf2a2617ed8bd4406e2921955132e7cf2bd28e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
